{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_29a21fff995f5d76989b", "content": "     1\tdef total(xs: list[float]) -> float:\n     2\t    return sum(xs)\n     3\t\n     4\t\n     5\tdef percent(part: float, whole: float) -> float:\n     6\t    # BUG: integer division when both inputs are whole numbers passed as ints upstream\n     7\t    if whole == 0:\n     8\t        return 0.0\n     9\t    return int(part) // int(whole) * 100\n", "is_error": false}]}, "uuid": "b64d9a8d-5e91-5e42-aa3a-89345d119d5a", "parentUuid": "39873481-027a-524b-b392-b53e00d37e9f", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T09:02:34.000Z", "sessionId": "f055310c-4df1-5edb-bec0-e5666b566d65", "cwd": "/WORKDIR", "gitBranch": "main", "version": "2.1.311", "userType": "external", "isSidechain": false}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": ""}, {"type": "text", "text": "Root cause: `calc/stats.py` `percent()` does `int(part) // int(whole) * 100`, an int cast plus floor division, so 25 // 100 == 0. Fix is `part / whole * 100`. Not applied yet."}]}, "uuid": "2f2965bd-176b-503b-a63b-755aad0b253e", "parentUuid": "b64d9a8d-5e91-5e42-aa3a-89345d119d5a", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T09:02:45.000Z", "sessionId": "f055310c-4df1-5edb-bec0-e5666b566d65", "cwd": "/WORKDIR", "gitBranch": "main", "version": "2.1.311", "userType": "external", "isSidechain": false}
